{"tool_name":"smorfunction","contents":["biotools","oeb"],"identifiers":["biotools:smorfunction"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"smorfunction","home":"http://www.cuilab.cn/smorfunction","summary":"A Tool for Predicting Functions of Small Open Reading Frames and Microproteins.\n\nsmORFunction is a tool for small open reading frame (smORF) and microprotein function prediction. We collected 617,462 unique smORFs from previous studies for searching. By re-annotating microarray probes to smORFs, we estimated smORF expressions for 173 datasets in GEO. Functions can further be predicted by co-expression genes of smORF. In this tool, we provide function predictions for 526,443 of these smORFs in at most 265 models, 48 tissues/cells, 82 diseases (and normal).\n\nA Tool for Small Open Reading Frame (smORF) / Microprotein Function Prediction.","addition_date":"2021-01-18T10:51:31Z","last_update_date":"2026-11-12T14:18:01.543867Z","biotools_curie":"biotools:smorfunction","edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Coding region prediction","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0436"},{"term":"Microarray probe design","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_0309"},{"term":"Standardisation and normalisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3435"}]}],"name":"smORFunction","owner":"zsmag19","publication":[{"doi":"10.1186/s12859-020-03805-x","type":["Primary"]},{"doi":"10.21203/RS.3.RS-47996/V3","type":["Preprint"]}],"topic":[{"term":"Functional, regulatory and non-coding RNA","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0659"},{"term":"Gene expression","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0203"},{"term":"Gene transcripts","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3512"},{"term":"Microarray experiment","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3518"},{"term":"Probes and primers","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0632"}]},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:smorfunction/undefined/www.cuilab.cn","@license":"http